Dialogue: 5,0:00:00.09,0:00:01.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}This year's El Niño
Dialogue: 5,0:00:01.18,0:00:02.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}could break a record.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:02.43,0:00:04.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}NOAA's September tenth forecast
Dialogue: 5,0:00:04.33,0:00:05.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}gives it a seventy-five percent
Dialogue: 5,0:00:05.79,0:00:06.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}chance this fall
Dialogue: 5,0:00:06.93,0:00:08.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}of beating past events
Dialogue: 5,0:00:08.29,0:00:09.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}since nineteen fifty.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:09.66,0:00:10.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Why so strong?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:10.79,0:00:12.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Exceptional heat at the surface,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:13.01,0:00:14.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}and deeper in the Pacific,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:14.60,0:00:15.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}is helping it strengthen.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:16.02,0:00:17.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}For America's winter,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:17.36,0:00:19.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}forecasts favor a wetter South
Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.30,0:00:20.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}and warmer North.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:20.55,0:00:22.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Elsewhere, shifting\Nrain patterns
Dialogue: 5,0:00:22.39,0:00:24.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}change flood and drought risks.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:24.64,0:00:25.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}But stronger doesn't mean
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.96,0:00:27.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}worse everywhere.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:27.38,0:00:29.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}El Niño changes the odds,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:29.39,0:00:30.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}not the weather on your street.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.05,0:00:02.95,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}THIS EL NIÑO\NCOULD MAKE HISTORY
